review_comments.body:
missing double-check after acquiring write lock - multiple goroutines can pass the initial check at line 45 and queue here, causing redundant asset loads

```suggestion
	entryPointAssetsCacheMu.Lock()
	defer entryPointAssetsCacheMu.Unlock()
	// Re-check cache after acquiring write lock
	if cfg.Env != setting.Dev && entryPointAssetsCache != nil {
		return entryPointAssetsCache, nil
	}
```

function `enableSqlExpressions` always returns false regardless of the feature flag state - the negation logic on line 195 is inverted and the function returns false in both branches

```suggestion
func enableSqlExpressions(h *ExpressionQueryReader) bool {
	return h.features.IsEnabledGlobally(featuremgmt.FlagSqlExpressions)
}
```
